      ],
      "note": "Their LD is pinching. Chip it past him or carry it out?",
      "answer": "Carry. He pinched late and the lane up the wall is open, so I take it out with speed and it's a 3-on-2. Chip it off the glass only when he's committed to the pinch and our C is swinging through the middle to pick it up."
    },
