  "notes": "Study play. Our RD recovers behind the net and rims it up my wall. I'm stopped at the hash marks before he has it, back to the boards, head up. Their LW comes along the wall and their LD pinches late, so I carry past him and out.",
  "captions": [
    {
      "t_ms": 0,
      "text": "Our RD recovers behind the net. Their C forechecks him. I'm at the hash marks on my wall, stopped, back to the boards."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 1500,
      "text": "RD rims it up my wall. I'm already stopped, so I take it with my body between the puck and their winger."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2000,
      "text": "I have it on the wall. Their LW comes along the wall and their LD at the point starts down. Head up before it arrived."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Their LD pinches, but late. The lane up the wall is open: carry."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3500,
      "text": "Past the pinch with speed. Our C is through the middle, our LW on the far wall."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4600,
      "text": "Zone exit. 3-on-2 the other way."
    }
  ]
